# Example release signing configuration.
# To sign with a production upload keystore, create 'key.properties' in this directory:
#
# storePassword=your_keystore_password
# keyPassword=your_key_password
# keyAlias=upload
# storeFile=../upload-keystore.jks
#
# If key.properties is not present, the build automatically falls back to the debug keystore,
# allowing seamless release APK builds out-of-the-box.
